{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"Apgan will turn to Jonathan, \"Did you see that?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T08:39:42.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866237785982500924","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Yes I did, I'm glad you saw it too\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T08:40:19.078000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866237941088124928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"For those of us who live on the shore of the Noir.\nStanding upon the constant assault of the worst within us.\nEdges of decision and indecision. \nChoices to be held on to, or passed to others.\nWe who live in the house between night and dawn\nFighting outward and inward against the same foes.","created_at":"2021-07-18T08:41:16.755000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866238183002996747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"Seeking now a future that can sustain us, so our dreams will not end in feeling a burden to others.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T08:42:06.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866238391807639572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"Words of hope are glimpsed for the first time since the war began.","created_at":"2021-07-18T08:42:27.441000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866238479482093598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
